  "faqTitle": "FAQ",
  "faqQ1": "How do I place an order?",
  "faqA1": "Add what you want to the cart, open the Cart tab and tap Checkout. The total, including delivery, is shown before you confirm.",
  "faqQ2": "How long does delivery take?",
  "faqA2": "Items in local stock arrive in 1–3 days. Orders from partner marketplaces take 10–20 days, depending on the seller.",
  "faqQ3": "How do I track my order?",
  "faqA3": "Open Profile → Active orders. Every step from confirmation to delivery is listed there.",
  "faqQ4": "Can I cancel an order?",
  "faqA4": "Yes, while it is still marked Confirmed. Once it has shipped, call the operator and we will help.",
  "faqQ5": "How do returns work?",
  "faqA5": "Call the operator within 3 days of delivery. Unused items in their original packaging are accepted.",
  "termsTitle": "Terms of use",
  "termsS1": "Using the app",
  "termsB1": "By using Elyeter you accept these terms. If you do not agree with them, please stop using the app.",
  "termsS2": "Orders and prices",
  "termsB2": "Prices are shown in TMT and may change until an order is confirmed. Availability at partner marketplaces is outside our control.",
  "termsS3": "Delivery",
  "termsB3": "Delivery times are estimates, not guarantees. Customs and seller delays can extend them.",
  "termsS4": "Returns",
  "termsB4": "Unused items in original packaging can be returned within 3 days of delivery. Made-to-order and personal-care items cannot.",
  "termsS5": "Your account",
  "termsB5": "Your phone number identifies your account. Keep it up to date — orders and delivery calls go to it.",
  "privacyTitle": "Privacy policy",
  "privacyS1": "What we collect",
  "privacyB1": "Your name, phone number, delivery address and order history. Nothing else is required to use Elyeter.",
  "privacyS2": "Why we use it",
  "privacyB2": "To deliver your orders, keep you updated about them and answer you when you contact support.",
  "privacyS3": "Who we share it with",
  "privacyB3": "Only couriers and payment providers, and only the part they need to complete your order. We never sell your data.",
  "privacyS4": "How long we keep it",
  "privacyB4": "While your account exists, plus the period accounting rules require for completed orders.",
  "privacyS5": "Your rights",
  "privacyB5": "Call the operator to get a copy of your data or ask for your account to be deleted.",
